<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine central bank lowers rate on 3-mth bills.</title>
<headline>Philippine central bank lowers rate on 3-mth bills.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank said on Tuesday it lowered the rate on the three-month special series Treasury bills to 13 percent from 13.10 percent.</p>
<p>Traders said this was in line with a fall in T-bill rates at auction on Monday.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
